    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Medicine</p><p>You have practiced the application and delivery of poisons until they became second nature to you.</p><ul><li><p>One per turn, you can apply poison to a weapon, food, or drink as a <strong>Free Action.</strong></p></li><li><p>You have <strong>Advantage</strong> on any checks to conceal applying poison.</p></li><li><p>You decrease the complexity of any <strong>Medicine</strong> checks to craft poisons by <strong>-1</strong> to a minimum of <strong>1</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
